steve-blender-connector adapts the STEVE protocol client, durable run loop,
panel builder/bridge and macOS service launcher from steve-prusa-connector,
itself adapted from stevecad/steve-bambu-connector:
https://github.com/stevecad/steve-bambu-connector
Reference commit: a674fbdd977bf9f87461a827d33bc39831252d44

The upstream MIT license and copyright notice are retained in LICENSE.
The bounded ZIP and 3MF reader derives from the local Prusa connector.
Blender transport, import adapter, motion baking and Blender panel are added here.
Blender and the Blender Lab MCP extension are installed separately and are not
distributed here. This project is not endorsed by Blender Foundation.
